ion skills\" in the structured notes. Yes, that is a strength. So we can argue that C's attention and concern for others mitigate communication issues. So we can reaffirm C as best.\n\nThus as agent_3, we will state we maintain vote for Candidate C, summarizing strengths: calm under pressure, technical competence, quick correct decisions, excellent attention, puts concern for others above everything. Concerns: difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, low adaptability. Compare with A's leadership but show-off and not open to new ideas, and B's nasty remarks, D's moody/loner. Conclude C remains best.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with agent \"agent_3\" and vote \"Candidate C\"."}
